BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bf3edfd6-d2bc-3885-8acb-5c718d43ae2d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
